title: Reggae in Six
key: Eb
tempo: 70
meter: 6/8
style: reggae

// Two slow pulses to the bar, three eighths in each, the drop on the second.
// Thirty-two bars, AABA, each chord held two bars. The A goes from the one to
// the six, the four and the five; its second time it comes home through the
// two and the five in one bar. The bridge opens on the four, goes down through
// the three and the two, and waits on the five.
[A]
| Eb | % | Cm | % |
| Ab | % | Bb | % |

[A2]
| Eb | %     | Cm | % |
| Ab | Fm Bb | Eb | % |

[Bridge]
| Ab | % | Gm | %   |
| Fm | % | Bb | Bb7 |

[A2]
